cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cayleygw in published work, please cite the paper below."
title: cayleygw
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/BoothGroup/CayleyGW
abstract: >-
  Cayley-moment G0W0 for closed-shell molecules on top of PySCF: the
  self-energy spectral moments after a Cayley transform, built by contour
  quadrature around the RPA spectrum and realized as a Hermitian upfolded
  Hamiltonian with explicit pole energies and weights.
keywords:
  - GW approximation
  - moment-conserving GW
  - Cayley transform
  - quantum chemistry
  - PySCF
authors:
